(7701331, 1264068, 67258, '<td valign="top">Time to take cover!  Impressive sky - I would love to see a wider photo, too, anchoring the sky to the ground.</td>', 'Time to take cover!  Impressive sky - I would love to see a wider photo, too, anchoring the sky to the ground.', '2021-09-15 05:18:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7701332, 1264153, 67258, '<td valign="top">I camped here many decades ago, but the weather was grey and dull.  Thank you for the memory!</td>', 'I camped here many decades ago, but the weather was grey and dull.  Thank you for the memory!', '2021-09-15 05:19:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7701333, 1264224, 67258, '<td valign="top">love the scale to this, and the artistic capturing of the light.  Very lovely.</td>', 'love the scale to this, and the artistic capturing of the light.  Very lovely.', '2021-09-15 05:20:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7701334, 1264142, 67258, '<td valign="top">I do like the banding of tones.</td>', 'I do like the banding of tones.', '2021-09-15 05:21:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7701335, 1264067, 67258, '<td valign="top">What a sky - and I like that the loan tree gives an idea of scale.</td>', 'What a sky - and I like that the loan tree gives an idea of scale.', '2021-09-15 05:22:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7701336, 1264246, 67258, '<td valign="top">Oh, what a lovely spot!</td>', 'Oh, what a lovely spot!', '2021-09-15 05:23:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7701337, 1264268, 67258, '<td valign="top">Just my sort of photo - quiet and gentle, almost melancholy.</td>', 'Just my sort of photo - quiet and gentle, almost melancholy.', '2021-09-15 05:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7701338, 1264119, 67258, '<td valign="top">Perfectly composed.  I really like this; my only niggle is the slight vignetting in the upper left corner - nonetheless one of my top scores.</td>', 'Perfectly composed.  I really like this; my only niggle is the slight vignetting in the upper left corner - nonetheless one of my top scores.', '2021-09-15 05:24:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7701339, 1264189, 67258, '<td valign="top">Now that is some rain!  I love your style of processing -really suits the photo.</td>', 'Now that is some rain!  I love your style of processing -really suits the photo.', '2021-09-15 05:25:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7701340, 1264266, 67258, '<td valign="top">Woah!!!</td>', 'Woah!!!', '2021-09-15 05:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7701341, 1264239, 67258, '<td valign="top">What a scene!  Looks like further avalanches will be on the cards here.  Amongst my favourites for this challenge.</td>', 'What a scene!  Looks like further avalanches will be on the cards here.  Amongst my favourites for this challenge.', '2021-09-15 05:26:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7701342, 1264227, 67258, '<td valign="top">Excellent!</td>', 'Excellent!', '2021-09-15 05:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7701343, 1264225, 67258, '<td valign="top">I''ve never seen someone with bags over shoes - I wonder how effective it was at keeping the wet out?  An excellent composition.</td>', 'I''ve never seen someone with bags over shoes - I wonder how effective it was at keeping the wet out?  An excellent composition.', '2021-09-15 05:29:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7701344, 1263975, 67258, '<td valign="top">A little bit of haloing around the trunks suggests processing may have been pushed just a tad too far, but a good composition .</td>', 'A little bit of haloing around the trunks suggests processing may have been pushed just a tad too far, but a good composition .', '2021-09-15 05:30:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7701345, 1264272, 67258, '<td valign="top">I often like people to be in landscape photos, but in this instance I feel that the photo would be far stronger without the runner.  The little flash of red brings the image up to another level.</td>', 'I often like people to be in landscape photos, but in this instance I feel that the photo would be far stronger without the runner.  The little flash of red brings the image up to another level.', '2021-09-15 05:31:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7701346, 1264265, 67258, '<td valign="top">An interesting scene, well photographed.  The organic contours of the foreground, the manmade structure and the jagged rocks of the mountains all juxtapose and combine to make a very effective photograph.</td>', 'An interesting scene, well photographed.  The organic contours of the foreground, the manmade structure and the jagged rocks of the mountains all juxtapose and combine to make a very effective photograph.', '2021-09-15 05:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7701347, 1264261, 67258, '<td valign="top">Lovely tonal range in this abstract that totally channels the theme.</td>', 'Lovely tonal range in this abstract that totally channels the theme.', '2021-09-15 05:34:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7701348, 1264249, 67258, '<td valign="top">Oh, how lovely.  I do so admire the softness of your photography and processing.  It lends an air of longing and melancholy.</td>', 'Oh, how lovely.  I do so admire the softness of your photography and processing.  It lends an air of longing and melancholy.', '2021-09-15 05:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7701350, 1264109, 67258, '<td valign="top">The greens are a little too vivid and saturated for my tastes, but otherwise, the photo nails the challenge.</td>', 'The greens are a little too vivid and saturated for my tastes, but otherwise, the photo nails the challenge.', '2021-09-15 05:42:29.000000', NULL, 1),
